(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-22","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["一阵[[flash|闪光]]照亮断轴，季禾举[[wrench|扳手]]，主动提出修车的[[initiative|办法]]。绳索却先[[snap|绷断]]，许庭不禁[[exclaim|惊叫]]，怕压碎货。经常在两村[[commute|往返劳作]]的农夫牵来[[buffalo|水牛]]，肯借一夜。关口给的一日[[grace|宽限]]明早[[expire|到期]]，车队不能只坐等雨停。季禾的[[discipline|训练]]使他先支稳轮再动螺栓，沈砚照做，知道快不等于乱。农夫被税挡在山上三天，牛吃光了草，他并不是无偿来给大家添一场感动的。","罗清听他讲自己的[[misery|困苦]]，说不必[[resign|放弃]]索酬。沈砚拿原用于买书的[[tuition|学费]]先付借牛钱，又请食队[[canteen|临时食棚]]给一家人盛饭。关口[[administration|管理部门]]称漏水只是小[[bug|故障]]，季禾却要[[estimate|估计]]剩余支桩能撑多久。山棚很不[[cozy|舒适]]，许庭的酒席[[entertainment|招待]]也不能把税路[[monopoly|垄断]]遮过去。地图把渡仓画得像[[castle|城堡]]，农夫笑它只有半堵墙，叫沈砚别照好看的图认安全，照昨日自己走过的路认。","修好的车仍缺一个[[bolt|螺栓]]，大家都是[[mortal|凡人]]，没有谁能隔空让它出现。季禾在[[calendar|历书]]背面列可拆的旧架，农夫的态度也渐渐[[cordial|热诚]]。夜里不能[[chase|追赶]]那位送契人，头顶[[galaxy|银河]]隐在云后，山道只靠灯。罗清把[[corn|玉米]]煮软，借[[string|细绳]]固定药箱里已有的[[prescription|处方]]包，不展示内容。车队决定[[appoint|指定]]季禾管修车，许庭却要求他只修货车。季禾回答，倒在路上的人和空车一样会挡路，先后看危险，不看谁付钱多。","关旗上[[patriotic|爱国的]]口号没有使路更宽。一个做过[[marine|海运]]的船工拿出[[nickel|镍]]扣，替代缺件，提醒沿河的[[course|路线]]仍有冲塌的地方。罗清包起伤者破损的[[tissue|组织]]附近衣布，又请沈砚认出路旁[[herb|药草]]，只为了避免孩子误食，不配药。沈砚的修为不能施展[[magic|法术]]，许庭以[[glare|怒目]]催他快走，他也只能用手。车轮碾入[[clay|黏土]]，农夫要求额外喂牛费，沈砚同意，并注明不是借牛钱被取消，而是新增的真实消耗。","这笔费用不能[[offset|抵销]]伤者旧债。大家扶车[[cross|越过]]浅沟，随队[[carpenter|木匠]]测了[[actual|实际的]]桥板厚度。罗清昨夜梦见屋顶压下来，醒后还被[[nightmare|噩梦]]缠着，她承认自己也怕；许庭的[[fury|暴怒]]让她更累。她请他[[anyway|无论如何]]别冲伤者喊，取下裂开的测温管，封存少量[[mercury|水银]]残迹，不让孩子摸。远处[[cuckoo|布谷鸟]]叫起时，第一辆[[cart|货车]]终于越沟，牛累得停下，没人敢再催它。","渡仓还在，却比农夫说的更破。新泥盖住半块旧门槛，岸边一棵柳已经泡在水里。季禾不忙下判断，先将旧图的高度与门槛刻痕对照；仓后水线比去年的高了半尺，门前河却浅得见底。河道转了，不是整条河一起涨。许庭只想卸货休息，沈砚答应先安顿人，再请他带着货号去敲仓门。守仓妇人听见旧堤二字才开门，说昨晚有人来借料册，借走之后，仓边就失了最后一只救生艇。孩子们听见这句，又往母亲身边挤了挤。"],"en":["A [[flash|flash]] lit the broken axle. Ji raised a [[wrench|wrench]] and proposed a repair [[initiative|initiative]]. A rope began to [[snap|snap]], making Xu [[exclaim|exclaim]] over cargo. A farmer who would [[commute|commute]] between villages lent a [[buffalo|buffalo]] overnight. The gate’s [[grace|grace]] would [[expire|expire]] tomorrow. Ji’s [[discipline|discipline]] meant supporting the wheel first. The farmer had been stranded three days and his animal had eaten its fodder; his help was not a free spectacle.","Luo heard his [[misery|misery]] and said he need not [[resign|resign]] his claim. Shen advanced book [[tuition|tuition]] money for the animal and arranged meals at the [[canteen|canteen]]. The gate [[administration|administration]] called leakage a [[bug|bug]]; Ji sought to [[estimate|estimate]] the piles’ remaining strength. The shelter was not [[cozy|cozy]], and Xu’s [[entertainment|entertainment]] could not conceal route [[monopoly|monopoly]]. A map made the ferry store a [[castle|castle]]. The farmer said only half a wall stood: use travelled ground, not attractive drawings.","One [[bolt|bolt]] remained missing. As [[mortal|mortal]] people, they had to find it. Ji listed reusable fittings behind a [[calendar|calendar]]; the farmer grew [[cordial|cordial]]. They could not [[chase|chase]] the messenger at night with the [[galaxy|galaxy]] hidden by clouds. Luo softened [[corn|corn]] and tied existing [[prescription|prescription]] packets with [[string|string]] without displaying their contents. They would [[appoint|appoint]] Ji to repairs. Xu wanted cargo vehicles first. Ji said fallen people blocked roads too; urgency, not payment, decided priority.","A [[patriotic|patriotic]] gate slogan did not widen the road. A sailor with [[marine|marine]] experience supplied a [[nickel|nickel]] fitting and warned about their riverside [[course|course]]. Luo secured clothing around injured [[tissue|tissue]], and Shen identified a roadside [[herb|herb]] so children would not eat it. He could no longer perform [[magic|magic]]. Xu’s [[glare|glare]] could not make him faster. Wheels entered [[clay|clay]]. Shen accepted extra animal feed costs, separately from the original hire rather than pretending they cancelled it.","New spending could not [[offset|offset]] injury debt. They helped the cart [[cross|cross]] a ditch as a [[carpenter|carpenter]] measured [[actual|actual]] planks. Luo admitted a falling-roof [[nightmare|nightmare]] still troubled her; Xu’s [[fury|fury]] exhausted her. She asked him, [[anyway|anyway]], to stop shouting at patients. She secured a broken thermometer’s [[mercury|mercury]] away from children. When a [[cuckoo|cuckoo]] called, the first [[cart|cart]] cleared the ditch. The buffalo stopped, and nobody pushed it further.","The store remained, more ruined than the farmer remembered. Mud covered its threshold and a willow stood submerged. Ji compared old height marks before judging: rear water was higher while the front channel was shallow. The river had changed course, not merely risen everywhere. Xu wanted rest. Shen settled people first and asked him to present cargo numbers. The keeper opened only at mention of the old dam. Someone had borrowed its material ledger last night; afterwards her last rescue boat disappeared. Hearing that, the children pressed closer to their mothers."]});
